\section{Model Equation}{

All maturity models use a logistic 50/95 parameterization:
\deqn{M(x) = \frac{1}{1 + \exp\left(-\ln(19) \cdot \frac{x - x_{50}}{x_{95} - x_{50}}\right)}}
}

